# HTML partials and pages

## Composition

Shared markup uses **`<load src="/path/to/partial.html" />`** (processed at build time by `vite-plugin-html-inject` — not JS includes).

- Partials: `src/_page-components/` (sections, menus, footer, FAQ, product content, bios)
- Icon fragments: `src/_icons/`
- Compose pages top-to-bottom with `<load>` tags + page-specific markup

## New page

Add `src/<route>/index.html` only — no vite config change.

## Formatting

At most **one consecutive blank line** between blocks (see `html-formatting.mdc`).

## Section docs

- Layout: `src/_page-components/SECTIONS.md`, `section-layout.mdc`
- Nav/menus: `src/_page-components/MENU.md` before editing menu partials
- Glass carousel nav: `src/_page-components/GLASS-SWIPER-NAV.md`
- FAQ tabs/icons: `src/_page-components/FAQ.md`

## Images

Prefer `loading="lazy"`, `decoding="async"`. Hero/critical images may use `fetchpriority="high"`. Icons that must show immediately: class `skip-img-fadein` (excluded from global fade-in in `script.js`).
